Package: easy-grbl
Version: 1.0.0
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Marcin Malessa <marcin@malessa.pl>
Depends: 
Description: CNC/laser control via GRBL
 EasyGRBL is a desktop app for controlling CNC and laser machines via
 the GRBL firmware, with SVG import, per-layer operation settings,
 G-code generation, and jog control.
